WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.150
Just what is that ship?

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.480
How can it maintain its firepower while being so agile?

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.360
Don't tell me...

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.660
Yes, the ship is interfacing with her brain to increase its computational power.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:18.030
It appears this ship was made solely for battle.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.290
Commander, port-side Territory is reaching its limit!

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.080
Redeploy Territory at maximum power!

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.580
And get Mystletainn ready to fire!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.790
Roger!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.670
Kannazuki!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.800
Ma'am!

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.220
Commander, now!

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.300
Agreed.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.930
Mystletainn, fire!

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.560
She's got some nerve!

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.190
Enemy is approaching!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.320
Leave it to me.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:59.160
Using the Yggdrafolium's Territory to cause the shot to change course... Clever.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.540
It was nothing.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.620
After all, it's impossible to live in this
 beautiful world without a scar or two.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.540
However...

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.580
What?

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:12.670
I think you're even more wonderful when you're on the offensive rather than the defensive, Commander!

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:16.930
Commander, Goetia is still approaching.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:25.020
Hey! Someone!

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.310
Is anyone there?!

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:30.320
Dammit! I need to get out of here!

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.200
Origami?

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.740
Did you change your mind?

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.910
After killing Yatogami Tohka, I'll regain who I am.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.540
No... don't tell me you...

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.650
An unbreakable vow of vengeance.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:17.740
She once again trudges into the depths of hell.

