00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.500
O-Origami?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.750
Episode 7: The Power Within

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.750
Episode 7: The Power Within

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.500
Oh man, your face right now! It's hilarious!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:56.170
It's so hilarious!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.880
Oh god, I can't breathe!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.760
Uh...

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.180
Shidou-san!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.390
Yoshino?!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.680
Are you okay, Shidou-san?!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.720
Wow, you're really getting the full hostage experience here.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:14.980
Come on, Yoshino. Now's your chance to do anything you want to hi—

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.860
Right, Yoshino! Stay away from Origami!
  There's something wrong with her!

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.610
Um,

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.610
Oh god, I can't breathe!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.990
I think we're in the clear now.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.290
Natsumi?!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.460
What? Got a problem with that?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.500
Mad that it's just me?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.960
No... but why are you two here?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.220
Well, I was showing Natsumi-san around town.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.470
And we saw you with Origami.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:51.310
And Yoshino was so curious we just had to follow you two, so—

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.730
Natsumi-san, you promised not to tell!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.980
You guys are life savers.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.520
Did I now?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.860
I'm so embarrassed! Why did you have to tell him that!

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:00.230
How about you untie me from this chair?

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.230
Sorry about that Yoshino!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:05.200
Fine. I guess I'll have to help you out.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.450
How?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.450
N-Natsumi?

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.960
Go to hell, all of you!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.960
Natsumi, was that...

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:27.720
I figured out that if I think of things that make me upset,

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:31.510
I can regain some of my powers.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.060
Things that make you upset?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.310
Yep.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.190
When I was still in school,

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.940
I didn't have any friends,
 so I would eat by myself in a bathroom stall.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:45.440
But one day I forgot to lock the door,
 and a classmate walked in on me in there.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.530
I just thought of that.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.320
That's beyond embarrassing.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.450
And when I got back to the classroom,
 everyone started quietly laughing at me.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.210
A-Anyway, moving on! How about we get out of here?!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.000
I can't get through to the Fraxinus.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.510
Do either of you know where Tohka and the others are?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:15.520
Tohka-san, are you awake now?

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.690
Miku!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.870
Tobiichi Origami!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.330
You wretch! Why are you doing this?!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.580
I don't understand your question.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.960
All of you are Spirits.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.840
Your very existence brings calamity to this world.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.920
You're enemies of all humans.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.720
Is that not enough of a reason?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.430
Don't make me repeat myself!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.220
Yuzuru!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.260
Anguish:

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:58.560
Master Origami... Why—

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.480
You wretch!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:10.530
Get your hands off Yuzuru, Origami!

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.250
Kaguya!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.170
It's been a long road.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.670
But I'm finally here.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.920
I finally have the power to kill Spirits and realize my wish!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.930
And from this, I will regain who I am.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:36.430
I'll kill every last Spirit in this world!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:41.140
No one will ever have to endure the same tragedies I have.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.150
Tobiichi Origami!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.440
<i>I'm rooted to this spot... I can't even move a muscle!</i>

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.400
<i>At this rate...</i>

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:55.410
<i>If... If I had a greater power—</i>

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.290
<i>No!</i>

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.210
<i>That power won't help anyone.</i>

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:07.170
<i>I have to do this while I'm still myself!</i>

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.920
<i>To save Kaguya...</i>

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.670
<i>To save Yuzuru...</i>

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.680
<i>To keep Miku alive...</i>

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.050
<i>Even for her...</i>

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.930
Shido, lend me strength!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.240
That form...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.960
I've never liked you, Tobiichi Origami.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.750
Not now. Not ever.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:50.000
But the hate I hold for you now is likely different to that which I harbored before.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.380
Even so,

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.550
I won't hold back!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.510
Don't die, Origami!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:38.930
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.890
<i>We're practically even in skill.</i>

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.350
<i>With Mordred in hand, I can...</i>

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.390
<i>I can kill the Spirit who took my
 parents from me! I can kill all of them!</i>

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.170
I hit my operation limit?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.090
We're not even at all.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:21.100
I was whittling away my life,
 in the hope I could match their strength.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.430
I've sacrificed so much, but I still can't...

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.850
I don't have anything left...

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.190
I...

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:38.110
Hey, you! Do you want more power?

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.780
What are you?

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:44.200
Answer me. Do you want more power?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:49.040
A power so absolute that no one will be able to stand against you ever again?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:54.710
I... want that power.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:59.010
I don't care what I have to give up or what I have to sacrifice.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:05.010
I want an absolute power that will help me realize my dream.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:09.020
A power that no one could ever hope to match—the ultimate power!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.480
I want it!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.360
Is this...

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.860
Reach out for the strength that you desire.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:24.370
I give this to you.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.830
What was that?

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.470
Report.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.100
We're detecting incredibly strong magic waves.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.230
These readings aren't consistent with anything DEM warned us about.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.860
Impossible. Are you saying this is a new Spirit?!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.730
But there's no spacequake...

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:00.240
The Spirit's coming to this world silently?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:06.580
<i>Why did DEM order us to bring in Origami for disciplinary action?</i>

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.910
<i>What were they planning?</i>

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.500
Tohka, that form...

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:19.760
Indeed. When I thought about how I had to protect all of you, my powers returned.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:24.010
Ques...tion: Tohka, where is Master Origami?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.720
I hit her hard in the stomach with the flat of my blade.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.270
She's still alive.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:33.520
I've heard they have something called a Terrier protecting their bodies.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:34.770
Teriyaki?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.400
Correction: You mean Territory, right?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.280
Miku!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.790
Make sure you thank her after she wakes up.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.830
She did everything she could to protect you while you were unconscious.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.790
Agreement: She was amazing.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.300
Indeed. You saved me, Miku.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:05.050
Exactly. So now you should try and wake her up.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.180
What should I do?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.600
Such a foolish question.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:12.930
There's only one way to wake a
 sleeping princess—a passionate kiss!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.940
A-A kiss?!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.310
Agreement: That is correct.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.730
Now go ahead. Go for it.

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.610
Kiss. Kiss.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:25.070
What?! I didn't say anything!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.860
Concur: Me neither.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.120
Wh-What?

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.290
Miku! You're awake, aren't you?!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.910
Aw, you found out?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.960
I was so close.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.340
You! Pretending to be me is a great crime!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.340
Scorn:

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.300
Pout.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.300
Sorry! Please forgive me!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.050
I'll take my punishment, whatever it may be!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.800
Do what must be done to my body!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.310
Is that...

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.820
Origami?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:06.450
Confirmation: You think so too, Kaguya?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.200
It's her, but that form...

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.950
Run!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.490
Tohka?

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.370
I can't fight while protecting all of you.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.960
Sorry, Tohka.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:18.620
Prayer: Best of luck.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:27.170
Yatogami Tohka, I will...

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.220
defeat you!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.220
Origami, you...

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:31.970
Metatron!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.230
Why are you a Spirit?!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.810
Spirit?

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.690
I see.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.900
But that's fine.

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.910
I will use this power to kill other Spirits!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:54.160
I will be a Spirit who kills other Spirits!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:15:01.540
And after I've killed all the Spirits, I'll kill myself!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.420
Metatron,

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:05.670
Shemesh!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.520
Shidou-san, over there!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.890
They're over there?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.200
I'm a monster...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.950
Mal'akh!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.330
Kadour!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:16.200
Origami! I'll ask you one more time!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.620
Can we really not talk this through?

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.500
Don't make me laugh!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.710
My wish will never change.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.830
My mission will never change.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.630
I will kill all Spirits!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.800
I see.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.470
Then you leave me no choice.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.680
I will hold nothing back.

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.260
Prepare yourself, you headstrong fool!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.140
Shut up!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.650
Sandalphon, Halvanhelev!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.900
Metatron, Artelif!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:54.070
Stop!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.370
Shidou!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.370
Shido!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.950
Why?!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.250
How did it end up like this?!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.750
Tohka! Origami!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.790
Origami!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:15.010
Origami!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.650
<i>I did that...</i>

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.710
<i>I'm a Spirit.</i>

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.710
<i>But...</i>

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.340
<i>I can kill them now.</i>

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.720
<i>Not just Yatogami Tohka.</i>

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.380
<i>Ifrit, and even Nightmare...</i>

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:06.020
If I can do that, then...

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:10.150
I see. So Origami became a Spirit?

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.860
No,

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.230
I'm not entirely sure what happened.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.950
After I knocked her down, she came back and she was—

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.070
You need to get some rest.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.340
Um, are you okay?

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.590
Wow, you guys really had your butts handed to you.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.170
What? This is nothing!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.340
Sighing: Kaguya's just acting tough.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.090
No I'm not! I'm perfectly fine!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.930
I'm so ugly that I might as well be a piece of trash.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:50.310
But you can reuse trash,
 so I guess I'm even lower than that.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.690
<i>She used up a lot of her power healing them.</i>

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.320
Ow, ow, ow...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:58.700
Miku, don't push yourself!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.990
I'm happy that you're worried about me, Darling.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:06.580
But I've got work to do while I still have some Spirit energy left.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.790
Work?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.250
Gabriel, requiem!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.800
Ladies and gentleman!

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.880
Welcome to this exclusive concert!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:22.050
Izayoi Miku's on stage!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.900
Admiration: The pain is fading away.

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:43.780
This is a song that numbs pain.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.910
It's only good for taking the pain away though.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.290
Thanks, Miku.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.920
Let's get you all to the hospital before the effects wear off.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.800
Can you walk, Tohka?

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.970
<i>I need to seal her powers, don't I?</i>

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:09.810
<i>If the AST find her, they'll sound the alarms.</i>

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.730
What's the matter, Shido?

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:15.150
U-Uh, you have a second?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.900
Shido, what are you doing?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.900
W-Well...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.990
O-Oh.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:30.410
S-So we're going to, uh... do it right here?

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.000
Um...

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.790
Yeah, I guess so.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.420
Shidou...

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.980
I can't see!

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:53.690
Shh! Quiet!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.690
Don't move!

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.190
Huh? Where'd Shidou go?

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.450
Seriously?

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.620
Oh? Itsuka-kun and Yatogami-san?

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.620
T-Tama-chan-sensei?!

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:12.330
Oh wow, you're all so hurt!

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.000
You should go to a hospital!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.380
I'll call them!

